Won't work.  __V40_OBJ_COMPAT is to allow you to link against 3rd 
party libraries that may need the older pre-v5.0 stat() and 
statfs() family of calls.

It is NOT so you can create stuff on a V5.* system and run it on 
pre-5.0 systems.

If you need something to run on a pre-v5.0 system, then build it 
there.

                                        Bob Harris


